<table border="0" cellpadding="5" width="600" cellspacing="5" height="400" >
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r1" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r1" locked="1" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial">{!Contact.FirstName},</font>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="300" >
<td tEditID="c1r2" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r2" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<div><font face="arial">Arizona State University received your updated high school transcripts and/or test scores, and has two important updates for you:</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><ol><li><span style="font-family: arial;">You are now eligible for direct admission into the BSN Nursing program (the traditional prelicensure clinical nursing program).</span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;">Your scholarship amount may have been updated.</span></li></ol></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>Direct admission into the BSN Nursing program</b></font></div><div><font face="arial">Like many nursing programs, Arizona State University has limited space. Students can move into the upper-division clinical program through one of two designated pathways. One of these pathways is <b>direct admission</b>. If you are a first-time freshman, you can be awarded direct admission based on your high school GPA or class rank, and performance on the SAT or ACT. Earning direct admission status means you are guaranteed placement in the upper-division clinical nursing program as long as you meet the continuing eligibility criteria during your first two years at ASU (requirements outlined in the Traditional BSN <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/programs/t5/majorinfo/ASU00/NUNURDBSN/undergrad/false">major map</a>).&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><span style="font-family: arial;"><b>Helpful articles:</b></span><br><ul><li><span style="font-family: arial;"><a href="https://asu.secure.force.com/kb/articles/FAQ/What-is-Direct-Admission-in-the-College-of-Nursing-Health-Innovation">What is direct admission in the College of Nursing and Health Innovation?</a></span></li><li><span style="font-family: arial;"><a href="https://asu.secure.force.com/kb/articles/FAQ/What-is-the-Difference-Between-Nursing-and-Community-Health/?q=community+health&amp;l=en_US&amp;fs=Search&amp;pn=1">What is the difference between nursing and community health?</a></span></li></ul></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>Scholarships</b></font></div><div><font face="arial">Verify your scholarship amount in <a href="https://webapp4.asu.edu/myasu/">My ASU</a> under the <b>Finances</b> tab along the black menu bar. You may also visit the <a href="https://scholarships.asu.edu/estimator">scholarship estimator</a> to determine the amount of scholarship money you may be eligible to receive.</font></div><div><font face="arial">&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><b>Next Steps</b></font></div><div><font face="arial">You must confirm that you would like to change your major to BSN Nursing by responding to this email, contacting us at <a href="mailto:asu.bsn@asu.edu">asu.bsn@asu.edu</a> or 602-496-0937.&nbsp;</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">We look forward to hearing from you.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
<tr valign="top" height="50" >
<td tEditID="c1r3" style=" background-color:#FFFFFF; color:#000000; bEditID:r3st1; bLabel:main; font-size:12pt; font-family:arial;" aEditID="c1r3" locked="0" >
<![CDATA[<font face="arial" style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span style="font-size: 12pt;">Sincerely,</span></font><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;">{!User.Name}</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">College of Nursing and Health Innovation</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Recruitment and Admissions</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Arizona State University</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">550 North 3rd Street | Phoenix, AZ 85004</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">602-496-0937</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><a href="mailto:asu.bsn@asu.edu">asu.bsn@asu.edu</a>&nbsp;</div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><span id="docs-internal-guid-a6b6cf11-ebdf-2c53-38e5-9b85218f608e"><span style="font-size: 14.6667px; font-family: Arial; font-style: italic; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255);">If you need any additional &nbsp;information or have questions, please reply to this email.</span></span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><font face="arial" size="1" color="#c0c0c0"><i>{!Case.Thread_Id}</i></font></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>